# The iac tier's Ansible: the community distribution, which bundles the
# collections a project needs (ansible.posix, community.general, community.docker,
# kubernetes.core and amazon.aws among them), because a session reaches no
# Galaxy server. boto3 and kubernetes are the Python libraries those
# collections import; jmespath backs the json_query filter.
